    - uuid: a79c58b23d4142b2b118683ec57e27ab
      template: 'Wiseway UPS'
      name: 'Wiseway UPS'
      description: |
        ## Overview
        UPS
        1.3.6.1.4.1.44782
        Repalce macro {$SNMP_COMMUNITY} with your snmp community
        https://github.com/QcaQca/Zabbix-Qca-Template
        ## Piotr
      groups:
